.el .ds Aq '
.TH batten-config 1  batten 
.SH NAME
batten\-config \- Inspect configuration
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBbatten config\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIsubcommands\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Inspect configuration
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
batten\-config\-show(1)
Print the effective configuration
.TP
batten\-config\-epoch(1)
Print the content hash of the governing config surface
.TP
batten\-config\-deprecations(1)
Report schema keys removed since a published release with no deprecation window
.TP
batten\-config\-lint(1)
Report policy smells in batten.toml (any smell is a violation)
.TP
batten\-config\-help(1)
Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)
